 "No GPS, or it is off" means the radio has no GPS or **Settings > Location > GPS** is off. A first fix outdoors takes
 from a few seconds to a few minutes; indoors there may be none.
+Turning GPS off clears the displayed measurements. After switching it back on, **Position** fills in the readings
+as the receiver sends them. Check **Sky** to see which satellite systems the receiver reports.
 
